     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Hi,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">I would like to insert math symbols in these text fields.<br>Is there a way to use Mathjax?</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">And related issues:</p>\r\n<ol style=\"margin:1.2em 0px;padding-left:2em\">\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\">When I add “&lt;” character to a string in a text field (title of legend) it is rendered as “&amp;lt”.</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin:0.5em 0px\">When I add UTF-8 character “≤” or “\\u2264” it gives a warning without plotting.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Is there a way to add such special characters?</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Thanks,<br>Shay.</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(221,221,221);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">library</span>(ggvis)\r\n\r\nggv &lt;- mtcars %&gt;% ggvis(x = ~wt, y = ~mpg, fill = ~cyl) %&gt;%\r\n  layer_points() \r\n\r\nggv %&gt;% add_legend(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;fill&quot;</span>, title = <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;&lt;&quot;</span>)\r\n\r\nggv %&gt;% add_legend(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;fill&quot;</span>, title = <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;≤&quot;</span>)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">## Warning message:</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">##   In readLines(conn) : incomplete final line found on &#39;&#39;</span>\r\n\r\nggv %&gt;% add_legend(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;fill&quot;</span>, title = <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;\\u2264&quot;</span>)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">## Warning message:</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">##   In readLines(conn) : incomplete final line found on &#39;&#39;</span>\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+SGksPGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5JIHdvdWxkIGxpa2UgdG8gaW5z\r\nZXJ0IG1hdGggc3ltYm9scyBpbiB0aGVzZSB0ZXh0IGZpZWxkcy48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PklzIHRoZXJl\r\nIGEgd2F5IHRvIHVzZSBNYXRoamF4PzwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+QW5kIHJlbGF0\r\nZWQgaXNzdWVzOjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+MS4gV2hlbiBJIGFkZCAiJmx0OyIg\r\nY2hhcmFjdGVyIHRvIGEgc3RyaW5nIGluIGEgdGV4dCBmaWVsZCAoPGcgY2xhc3M9ImdyXyBncl8x\r\nOTIgZ3ItYWxlcnQgZ3JfZ3JhbW0gR3JhbW1hciBvbmx5LWlucyBkb3VibGVSZXBsYWNlIHJlcGxh\r\nY2VXaXRob3V0U2VwIiBpZD0iMTkyIiBkYXRhLWdyLWlkPSIxOTIiPnRpdGxlPC9nPiBvZiBsZWdl\r\nbmQpIGl0IGlzIHJlbmRlcmVkIGFzICImYW1wO2x0Ii48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PjIuIFdoZW4gSSBhZGQg\r\nVVRGLTggY2hhcmFjdGVyICLiiaQiIG9yJm5ic3A7Ilx1MjI2NCIgaXQgZ2l2ZXMgYSB3YXJuaW5n\r\nIHdpdGhvdXQgcGxvdHRpbmcuPGJyPjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+SXMgdGhlcmUgYSB3YXkg\r\ndG8gYWRkIHN1Y2ggc3BlY2lhbCBjaGFyYWN0ZXJzPzwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+\r\nVGhhbmtzLDwvZGl2PjxkaXY+U2hheS48L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PjxnIGNsYXNz\r\nPSJncl8gZ3JfMzg3IGdyLWFsZXJ0IGdyX3NwZWxsIENvbnRleHR1YWxTcGVsbGluZyBpbnMtZGVs\r\nIG11bHRpUmVwbGFjZSIgaWQ9IjM4NyIgZGF0YS1nci1pZD0iMzg3Ij5gYGByPC9nPjwvZGl2Pjxk\r\naXY+PGRpdj5saWJyYXJ5KGdndmlzKTwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Z2d2ICZsdDst\r\nIG10Y2FycyAlJmd0OyUgZ2d2aXMoeCA9IH53dCwgeSA9IH5tcGcsIGZpbGwgPSB+Y3lsKSAlJmd0\r\nOyU8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZuYnNwOyBsYXllcl9wb2ludHMoKSZuYnNwOzwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwv\r\nZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Z2d2ICUmZ3Q7JSBhZGRfbGVnZW5kKCJmaWxsIiwgdGl0\r\nbGUgPSAiJmx0OyIpPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5nZ3YgJSZndDsl